# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for the server and conformance suites under the
# `thread sanitizer` job (.github/workflows/server.yml; TSAN_OPTIONS=suppressions=...).
#
# Every entry hides reports, so each names known-benign behaviour in third-party code
# (DuckDB internals, OpenSSL, the C++ runtime) with the reason. Never a Hardcharger or
# warp-sql symbol: a race there is a bug to fix, not to suppress. Syntax:
#   race:<symbol or file substring>   thread_leak:<...>   deadlock:<...>
# https://github.com/google/sanitizers/wiki/ThreadSanitizerSuppressions
